POST {{baseUrl}}/medicamentos
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMaria.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Atualizacao parcial do remedio cadastrado acima (esperado 200, so a dosagem muda)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/medicamentos/{{cadastrarMedicamento.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMaria.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "dosagem": 40
}

### Mudar o horario refaz a agenda futura (esperado 200). DUVIDA 5
### Conferir em "Doses de hoje": as doses previstas mudam de horario, as tomadas continuam iguais
PUT {{baseUrl}}/medicamentos/{{cadastrarMedicamento.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{loginMaria.response.body.token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "horarioInicial": "09:00",
  "frequenciaHoras": 8
}

